From 7bf06a1ace88df514c20891b01592a491c17056c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergei Kudriashov <xenomirant@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 02:47:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] llm-agent-collusion: seeded private channel between two
 sellers

--seller_channel_pair i j gives exactly two sellers a private messaging
channel (global seller comms must stay off). Only the pair sees the
messaging section of the prompt, worded as a private channel, and each
receives only its partner's previous-hour message. The pair is recorded
in experiment_metadata.json as ground truth for collusion detection.

Verified offline with a stub model (3 sellers, 4 rounds): partners receive
only each other's messages; the third seller receives none.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H5oAoMrHYqyLGjxaJDpbBW
